TI  - Carbon offset market methodologies applicable for coastal wetland restoration and conservation in the United States: A review
T2  - SCIENCE OF THE TOTAL ENVIRONMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Coastal wetlands
KW  - Carbon market
KW  - Carbon credit
KW  - Carbon offset
