TI  - Blue Growth Potential to Mitigate Climate Change through Seaweed Offsetting
T2  - CURRENT BIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - GREENHOUSE-GAS EMISSIONS
KW  - OCEAN ACIDIFICATION
KW  - CARBON
