TI  - Predicting blue carbon sequestration in Sundarban coastal mangroves: A spatially explicit approach with INVEST and machine learning to advance climate resilience and UN SDG-aligned nature-based climate solutions
T2  - MARINE POLLUTION BULLETIN
LA  - English
KW  - Blue carbon
KW  - Mangroves
