TI  - Carbon sequestration potential of Sonneratia apetala plantation forests in the Chakaria Sundarbans: Effects of stand age and structure
T2  - REGIONAL STUDIES IN MARINE SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Global warming
KW  - Natural mangrove forest
KW  - Vegetation biomass
KW  - Carbon stock
KW  - Reforestation project
