TI  - Life cycle assessment of ocean liming for carbon dioxide removal from the atmosphere
T2  - JOURNAL OF CLEANER PRODUCTION
LA  - English
KW  - Carbon dioxide removal (CDR) or negative
KW  - emissions technology (NET)
