TI  - Using eDNA tools to examine the impact of kelp farming on underlying sediments
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - CARBON-DIOXIDE REMOVAL
KW  - ORGANIC-CARBON
KW  - MARINE
KW  - AQUACULTURE
