TI  - The Impact of Whaling on the Ocean Carbon Cycle: Why Bigger Was Better
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - IRON FERTILIZATION
KW  - HUMPBACK WHALES
KW  - KILLER WHALES
