TI  - Membrane-Mediated Delivery of Carbon Dioxide for Consumption by Photoautotrophs: Eliminating Thermal Regeneration in Carbon Capture
T2  - INDUSTRIAL & ENGINEERING CHEMISTRY RESEARCH
